>&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCCDE90"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCCDFC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your time earlier. It was great getting to know you and learning more about your business. As promised, I'm sharing further information regarding the benefits of your Qantas Business Rewards membership and how you can extract the most value for your business.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCCADF0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD0210"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD0470">I appreciate you raising XXX during our call. I have looked into this for you and found XXX</mark>. If you require further assistance with this, please let me know.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD0930"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD0CC0">Some helpful links are listed below which we recommend saving for quick and easy navigation:</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD1770" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD18A0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/myaccount" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD19D0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Qantas Business Rewards Account</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD1B00" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD1C30" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards flying benefits</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD1D60" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/manage-travel/travel-fund.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD1E90" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Get familiar with Travel Fund</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD1FC0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/qantas-club" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD20F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD2220" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/gold-accelerator" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CCD2350" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Exclusive Qantas Business Rewards Level 3 Gold Accelerator</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CF9E080" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/save-on-qantas-club.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CF9E2E0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CF9E780" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/gold-accelerator.html?utm_source=Frequent_Flyer&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=qbr-gold-accel&amp;utm_content=secondary-cta1" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA1530" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Exclusive Qantas Business Rewards Level 3 Gold Accelerator</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA19F0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-on-business-expenses.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA3610" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn points on business expenses through our 50+ partners</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA3870" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA3AD0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to make the most out of the stored traveller feature</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA3D30" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA40C0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards How-To Guides</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA4410" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA4760" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards FAQs</font></a></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CF9E540">As we covered in our call, below is an overview of the key benefits available to your business through Qantas Business Rewards:</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA4AF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA4E40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA5190"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA81A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA8400"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA8660"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA88C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA9470"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA9DC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAA020" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-flights.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA2360" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAA280" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA2DF0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAA4E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAA740"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAAAD0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAAE20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAB170">Save on flights</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFA8D70">Take your business even further for less, with up to 10% savings on eligible domestic and international fares to over 1,300 destinations with Qantas,&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAB4C0">one</strong>world<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAB720" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">®</sup>&nbsp;and partner airlines<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFABAB0" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">~</sup>. Plus, enjoy a range of exclusive offers on top of your year-round member savings on international and domestic flights for even more value.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFABE40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAC1D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CFAC8D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C786AE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C789310"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C789DA0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78A000" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78A130"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78A700"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78ADD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78B4E0" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78B5F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78B870"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78B980" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78BD10"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78C190"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78C610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78D6F0">Earn Qantas Points</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78D4A0">Earn points* for your business on top of the points and Status Credits you and your employees earn as a Frequent Flyer<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C790A60" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup>. As a Level 3 member, you can earn 40 Qantas Points for your business for every 100 points your flyers earn. Plus, book a hotel through your Business Account and earn even more - up to 6 points per $1 spent (3 points for the business, and 3 points for the Frequent Flyer.)</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C790B90"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C790DF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C790F20"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C791050" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7912B0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C791770"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7919D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C791D50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C791FB0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C792210" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C792340" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7926B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C793130"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7935F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C793720"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C794D80"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE06A00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE08B30">Business travel</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C795A90">Easily book and manage flights, hotels and car hire directly from your Business Account. All the Qantas Points your business earns on Qantas and Jetstar flights, Qantas hotels and car hire count towards your membership level, making it easier to retain your Level 3 savings and benefits. Plus, access real-time reporting and set your business’ travel policy.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0CAA0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0D8F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0DC80"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0E230" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0F250"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0F5E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0FCE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE10D70"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE11200"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE11330" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/wallet-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE07EA0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE11B20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE088F0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE11C50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE12460"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE12A50"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE13830" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE13960">Access Travel Fund</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0C5F0">Travel Fund allows you to store and combine the value from flights you need to cancel or change, in your Business Account. Use it instantly as a payment option, for anyone in your business, on any eligible flight.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE13D20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE147C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE14C80"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29B7F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29BDE0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29C040"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29C170" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29C2A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29C3D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29C500" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-reporting-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29CC20" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D210" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D340"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D450" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D580"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D6B0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D7E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D910">Access real-time reporting and set your business' travel policy</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29E510">Gain valuable insights into your team’s booking behaviour and track your travel spend, policy compliance and easily download expense reports, along with creating and managing your business' travel policy.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29E9D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29EE90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29EFC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29F0F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid